Source: ethercat
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Luca Toniolo <toniolo.luca@gmail.com>
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 dh-sequence-dkms,
 autoconf,
 automake,
 libtool,
 pkg-config,
 linux-headers-amd64 [amd64] | linux-headers-arm64 [arm64] | linux-headers-generic
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://etherlab.org/ethercat

Package: ethercat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, lsb-base
Recommends: ethercat-dkms
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master userspace tools and library
 Open-source EtherCAT master implementation for Linux.
 This package provides the ethercat command-line tool,
 the libethercat shared library, the init script and
 sysconfig defaults.

Package: ethercat-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ethercat (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master development files
 Headers, static library and libtool archive for building
 applications against the IgH EtherCAT master userspace
 library.

Package: ethercat-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1), autoconf, automake, libtool, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ethercat (= ${binary:Version})
Description: IgH EtherCAT Master kernel modules (DKMS)
 Source for the IgH EtherCAT master and native Ethernet
 driver kernel modules, built via DKMS against the running
 kernel. Equivalent to the openSUSE kernel-module package.
